    {"Try to find usernames without @ prefix",
     "Namen auch ohne @ erkennen"},
    {"Try to use Twitch's timestamp (the time when the message was received by Twitch's chat server), rather than your computer's local timestamp. Note that using this setting can result in out-of-order timestamps in the log files, and that if Twitch's timestamp was unavailable for a message, it will fall back to your computer's local timestamp.",
     "Nimmt die Uhrzeit von Twitchs Chat-Server statt der deines Rechners. Dadurch können Zeiten im Protokoll durcheinandergeraten; fehlt Twitchs Zeit, wird doch die deines Rechners benutzt."},
    {"Twemoji emojis provided by <a href=\"https://github.com/twitter/twemoji\">Twitter's Twemoji</a>",
